WEBVTT

00:03.740 --> 00:05.940
A quest from the merchants' guild?

00:05.940 --> 00:09.050
Yeah. Cargo keeps getting stolen

00:09.050 --> 00:11.940
from merchant ships over in 
the port town of Frimeille.

00:11.940 --> 00:13.970
The quest is to investigate the thefts,

00:14.380 --> 00:18.950
and if possible, to capture the 
thieves and find the stolen cargo.

00:19.170 --> 00:21.940
Hmm... A port town, huh?

00:23.580 --> 00:24.460
The ocean!

00:36.990 --> 00:38.130
Yoki!

00:40.550 --> 00:42.640
That quest is mine!

00:46.260 --> 00:47.310
I'm here.

00:48.220 --> 00:49.110
Hey.

00:52.170 --> 00:54.030
What?! You can't go?!

00:54.260 --> 00:56.740
I have important work to do.

00:56.740 --> 01:01.490
I really can't leave Minerva for 
several days straight right now.

01:04.780 --> 01:05.470
Stupid.

01:05.470 --> 01:06.970
I know, okay?!

01:06.970 --> 01:10.820
Failing to check Cecilia's schedule 
in advance was my mistake!

01:12.030 --> 01:14.420
What's that at your waist?

01:14.730 --> 01:15.670
Weapon.

01:16.130 --> 01:19.350
Wait, are those your feathers?

01:19.940 --> 01:20.850
Yes.

01:20.850 --> 01:23.150
My body.

01:23.150 --> 01:25.520
Cut it out! You'll give 
people the wrong idea!

01:25.520 --> 01:26.600
Roger.

01:27.000 --> 01:29.190
You're unusually obedient today.

01:30.110 --> 01:31.230
Sorry for keeping you.

01:33.980 --> 01:37.200
Happiness? Why are you here?

01:40.660 --> 01:41.660
Morning.

01:45.510 --> 01:48.620
Th-That... hair accessory...

01:52.210 --> 01:55.080
Now departing for Frimeille.

01:56.070 --> 01:57.180
Roger.

01:58.250 --> 02:01.680
Why is Happiness here? This 
isn't a pleasure trip.

02:01.980 --> 02:04.970
I asked her to come because she 
could be valuable in battle.

02:05.540 --> 02:07.640
She's pretty skilled with magic.

02:08.430 --> 02:09.930
Really?

02:10.790 --> 02:13.400
I didn't even know that about her.

02:13.740 --> 02:17.340
Of course not. You pretty 
much just met her.

02:17.800 --> 02:19.830
You have plenty of time 
to get to know her.

02:21.130 --> 02:22.870
C'mon, let's go.

02:31.170 --> 02:33.820
Dude, you should be sitting 
next to Happiness!

04:05.970 --> 04:08.020
We're finally here.

04:09.250 --> 04:11.630
I'm gonna go meet the client.

04:11.630 --> 04:13.690
You guys start asking around.

04:13.690 --> 04:14.970
Got it.

04:14.970 --> 04:17.030
I-I...

04:17.030 --> 04:19.020
Okay, I'm counting on you.

04:19.980 --> 04:22.490
Since they're both here, 
I'll give them time alone.

04:26.840 --> 04:28.170
Information.

04:28.170 --> 04:29.200
Huh?

04:29.490 --> 04:32.020
You need something, miss?

04:32.770 --> 04:33.710
Quest.

04:34.170 --> 04:36.530
Quest? What does that mean?

04:39.340 --> 04:42.210
"We're here to do a quest 
for the merchants' guild.

04:42.450 --> 04:46.630
We'd like you to tell us what you 
know about the thefts on the ships.

04:46.630 --> 04:48.990
Do you have any idea who 
might have done it?"

04:49.690 --> 04:52.740
If I knew that, I wouldn't be 
having such a hard time here.

04:52.740 --> 04:55.890
Even when I post guards, 
stuff still gets stolen.

04:56.700 --> 04:58.070
Mysterious.

04:58.070 --> 04:59.060
I guess so.

04:59.410 --> 05:04.320
And the guys upstairs treat us 
sailors like we're the thieves.

05:04.690 --> 05:05.870
Innocent?

05:05.870 --> 05:09.210
Of course! Men of the sea never steal!

05:09.590 --> 05:11.750
We'll investigate.

05:11.750 --> 05:13.750
You believe me?

05:14.110 --> 05:15.710
Thanks.

05:16.030 --> 05:18.390
Men of the sea don't keep secrets.

05:18.390 --> 05:19.960
You can ask me anything.

05:20.250 --> 05:22.910
Hey, boys! Gather up!

05:27.380 --> 05:29.300
You wanna know about the thefts?

05:29.300 --> 05:31.500
We're innocent, ya know!

05:31.500 --> 05:32.930
Want some candy, miss?

05:36.670 --> 05:38.850
What a sausage fest.

05:40.500 --> 05:42.980
Hey, hard at work, huh? How's it going?

05:43.810 --> 05:48.110
No one has any information 
about the thief at all.

05:48.570 --> 05:51.450
All the ships have had 
guards posted at all times,

05:51.450 --> 05:53.860
but no one remembers the 
moment the thefts happen.

05:53.860 --> 05:55.620
That sounds weird.

05:55.620 --> 05:57.790
Yes, it's weird.

05:57.790 --> 06:02.130
If the sailors were behind it, I'd 
think they'd come up with a better lie.

06:02.390 --> 06:05.090
So you think it was someone else?

06:05.090 --> 06:08.660
Some said that right before 
their memories cut off,

06:08.660 --> 06:11.120
they could hear a beautiful singing voice.

06:11.120 --> 06:12.140
Singing?

06:12.370 --> 06:14.970
I suspect demons are involved.

06:15.320 --> 06:16.640
Probably mermaids.

06:16.860 --> 06:18.110
Mermaids...

06:21.420 --> 06:23.610
I'd love to meet one.

06:24.030 --> 06:27.160
Hey, Happiness! I hear there's 
a mermaid around here?

06:27.470 --> 06:28.360
Don't!

06:30.150 --> 06:32.340
So it really was a mermaid?

06:32.340 --> 06:34.670
Masa, this is real bad!

06:34.670 --> 06:37.080
We're all gonna get eaten!

06:38.110 --> 06:40.540
Hey, you guys are adventurers, aren't you?

06:40.540 --> 06:42.650
So get rid of that mermaid!

06:42.650 --> 06:45.050
Yeah, that's right!

06:45.510 --> 06:46.710
Please!

06:45.510 --> 06:48.470
Huh? Are mermaids that scary?

06:48.900 --> 06:50.600
You really don't know?

06:50.930 --> 06:52.990
Tons of sailors 
have ended up shipwrecked

06:52.990 --> 06:55.930
or even killed by mermaids.

06:56.860 --> 06:59.780
And the sea around here was so safe...

06:59.780 --> 07:02.690
Now we're too scared to get on our boats!

07:03.990 --> 07:08.210
"I am Raven, captain of 
the knights of Clariness.

07:09.830 --> 07:12.350
It is a knight's duty 
to protect the people.

07:12.350 --> 07:14.850
I will defeat the mermaid without fail."

07:15.210 --> 07:17.530
You're the knight captain 
from the hero's party?!

07:18.390 --> 07:19.710
I'm so glad you're here!

07:19.710 --> 07:22.040
You gotta take out those demons for us!

07:28.990 --> 07:30.940
I guess, from the humans' perspective,

07:31.350 --> 07:34.040
demons and monsters are 
things to be feared, huh?

07:35.780 --> 07:36.930
Recluse.

07:36.930 --> 07:38.540
Where'd that come from?!

07:39.640 --> 07:43.690
Truth. Demon King's army. Conquer humans.

07:43.690 --> 07:47.090
I know. I just forgot for a second.

07:48.180 --> 07:49.400
Sorry to keep you.

07:50.870 --> 07:52.380
Done with what you needed to do?

07:52.380 --> 07:53.280
Yeah.

07:53.280 --> 07:55.270
I got more paper and pens.

07:56.610 --> 07:57.820
Good work.

07:58.510 --> 08:00.270
Th-Thank you.

08:05.130 --> 08:06.060
Eat.

08:06.060 --> 08:06.890
Right...

08:08.360 --> 08:09.370
It's sweet.

08:11.740 --> 08:14.720
What's sweet here is the 
mood you guys are setting.

08:14.950 --> 08:18.410
Yoki, I found someone who 
claims he saw a mermaid.

08:18.410 --> 08:19.210
Huh?

08:19.530 --> 08:22.680
When I was shopping, a man 
came up and talked to me.

08:26.600 --> 08:29.560
Um... Captain?

08:29.250 --> 08:31.240
WHAT?

08:31.240 --> 08:33.740
Y-Yes, sir! The thing is...

08:33.740 --> 08:39.700
I saw those sailors hiding the 
cargo in a cove just outside town.

08:39.700 --> 08:41.330
And there was...

08:41.330 --> 08:43.620
a mermaid in there!

08:45.080 --> 08:47.580
That sounds kinda shady.

08:47.580 --> 08:50.010
But I think we need to make sure.

08:51.020 --> 08:52.660
Happiness, you can wait here.

08:53.470 --> 08:54.490
No.

08:54.490 --> 08:56.540
Fighting demons is dangerous.

08:58.260 --> 08:59.240
Why?

08:59.940 --> 09:02.750
There was once a village 
where demons ran rampant.

09:03.420 --> 09:04.730
At the time...

09:13.240 --> 09:17.110
there were so many lives 
I failed to protect.

09:20.030 --> 09:23.690
I'm a knight. It's my job 
to protect the people.

09:24.020 --> 09:26.070
I'll be sure to defeat the mermaid.

09:26.660 --> 09:28.650
So don't worry. I'll be back.

09:30.620 --> 09:31.960
Absolutely not.

09:32.630 --> 09:33.310
Huh?

09:34.200 --> 09:35.260
Come on.

09:35.260 --> 09:36.870
H-Happiness?!

09:36.870 --> 09:38.580
Hey, she'll be fine.

09:38.580 --> 09:41.390
She's a hundred times 
stronger than she looks.

09:41.690 --> 09:43.790
Er... but...

09:45.990 --> 09:47.400
This must be it.

09:48.980 --> 09:50.020
Wooden box.

09:51.150 --> 09:52.520
Yep, no doubt about it.

09:52.940 --> 09:55.810
It all matches the descriptions 
of the stolen cargo.

09:57.450 --> 09:58.380
Ocean.

09:58.380 --> 10:01.200
This cove's too small to dock a boat in.

10:02.150 --> 10:03.200
Raven?

10:03.730 --> 10:04.810
Something's there.

10:20.590 --> 10:21.600
Oh, no!

10:21.970 --> 10:23.100
Cover your ears!

10:29.640 --> 10:32.310
If I let my guard down, I'll 
be asleep in a heartbeat.

10:34.410 --> 10:35.650
Happiness!

10:35.650 --> 10:36.780
What are you doing?!

10:46.450 --> 10:50.340
Happiness is using her own song 
to cancel out the mermaid's?

10:50.730 --> 10:51.670
Yoki!

10:51.930 --> 10:52.770
Right!

10:58.340 --> 10:59.550
You're not getting away!

11:11.810 --> 11:14.100
I don't care if I die.

11:14.100 --> 11:16.090
But, please, I need your help.

11:16.090 --> 11:19.400
My friend has been captured by the humans.

11:21.910 --> 11:23.780
She hasn't done anything.

11:23.780 --> 11:25.580
Please, just make sure she survives!

11:25.580 --> 11:26.660
Quiet.

11:27.080 --> 11:29.380
I won't be deceived by 
the words of a demon.

11:36.830 --> 11:37.880
Dislike.

11:56.250 --> 11:57.370
Happiness?

12:00.630 --> 12:03.740
Move, Happiness.

12:04.250 --> 12:05.240
No.

12:06.180 --> 12:07.950
Why are you protecting a demon?

12:09.460 --> 12:10.260
Don't.

12:11.690 --> 12:15.690
Hey, Raven, just put the 
sword down for now. Okay?

12:15.690 --> 12:18.200
You're siding with the demon, too?

12:18.710 --> 12:22.670
No. If she attacked humans, 
she ought to be taken out.

12:22.990 --> 12:27.240
I wouldn't show mercy to anyone 
who hurt me or my friends, either.

12:27.560 --> 12:28.740
Then why?

12:29.150 --> 12:31.660
Because it sounds like she has a reason.

12:31.660 --> 12:33.980
It can't hurt to hear her out first.

12:36.770 --> 12:37.790
Please.

12:40.250 --> 12:41.230
All right.

12:51.350 --> 12:52.550
You okay?

12:54.990 --> 12:55.910
Fine.

12:56.830 --> 12:59.400
Yeah? You've gotten stronger.

13:00.270 --> 13:01.650
U-Um...

13:02.090 --> 13:04.140
Oh, sorry. Forgot about you.

13:05.820 --> 13:09.100
Well, if something's going 
on, tell us about it.

13:09.540 --> 13:12.730
You all believe me?

13:13.780 --> 13:15.600
I do.

13:15.600 --> 13:16.920
Really?

13:17.730 --> 13:18.650
Really.

13:23.790 --> 13:25.460
This is so awkward!

13:25.860 --> 13:28.640
Okay, then! Time for introductions!

13:28.640 --> 13:32.120
I'm Yoki the adventurer. Nice to meet ya!

13:34.010 --> 13:35.510
Did you hit your head?

13:35.510 --> 13:37.260
I'm perfectly sane, you dolt!

13:37.260 --> 13:39.840
I'm trying to lighten up the mood here!

13:40.300 --> 13:42.490
This rude one here is Happiness,

13:42.490 --> 13:45.800
and the sulking guy who refuses 
to look at you is Raven.

13:46.840 --> 13:50.300
Um... my name is Shike.

13:50.300 --> 13:54.810
Okay, Shike, why did you 
try to put us to sleep?

13:55.620 --> 13:57.420
A human ordered me to.

13:58.620 --> 14:03.550
We normally try to avoid 
getting close to humans,

14:03.550 --> 14:04.820
but one day...

14:10.090 --> 14:12.370
I was playing with my friend, Misaki,

14:13.700 --> 14:16.080
when we were caught up in a sudden storm.

14:16.620 --> 14:21.040
Next thing I knew, we'd 
been captured by humans.

14:21.320 --> 14:25.050
If you want your friend to 
live, you'll do as I say!

14:28.130 --> 14:30.580
then I just followed that 
human's orders and sang

14:30.920 --> 14:33.780
to put the people on the boats to sleep.

14:35.150 --> 14:38.060
Well, it doesn't seem like she's lying.

14:38.780 --> 14:41.390
Yoki, don't be fooled by appearances.

14:41.970 --> 14:43.570
You can't trust her?

14:43.860 --> 14:47.070
Of course I could never trust a demon.

14:55.150 --> 15:00.830
Then... trust me as I trust her.

15:03.610 --> 15:04.700
I...

15:07.400 --> 15:08.500
All right.

15:08.920 --> 15:13.090
I'll start a new investigation 
based on what the mermaid said.

15:17.960 --> 15:19.350
Empty.

15:19.690 --> 15:22.970
Yeah, these are just 
fakes left here for show.

15:23.640 --> 15:28.170
So the thief leaked information 
to lure his pursuers here,

15:28.520 --> 15:33.090
where he'd have the mermaid put 
them to sleep to silence them.

15:33.090 --> 15:36.430
What?! We were about to be killed?!

15:36.810 --> 15:39.570
It's a pretty roundabout 
method for a demon.

15:40.850 --> 15:44.120
Hey, Shike, do you know where 
the thief's hideout is?

15:44.700 --> 15:50.130
I'm sorry. He blindfolded me 
during transit, so I don't know.

15:50.600 --> 15:52.440
What to do?

15:52.860 --> 15:54.710
If my hunch is correct,

15:54.710 --> 15:57.040
the thieves should show up here soon.

15:57.040 --> 15:58.640
We can make them tell us.

15:59.450 --> 16:01.190
Let me be the one to make sure.

16:03.050 --> 16:06.820
Never thought we'd catch the 
eye of the knight captain!

16:06.820 --> 16:09.860
Maybe it's about time we 
moved to another island.

16:14.250 --> 16:17.090
Ah, Captain! I'm glad to see you're safe.

16:17.090 --> 16:19.450
We were worried, so we 
wanted to check on you...

16:20.440 --> 16:22.460
Are you the thieves?

16:22.700 --> 16:24.130
Huh? What?

16:24.130 --> 16:25.580
Dude, what's with your voice?

16:25.580 --> 16:27.790
It sounds so weird!

16:29.660 --> 16:30.710
Fools.

16:31.750 --> 16:36.110
Both you and I are beneath that mermaid. 
At least she cares for her friend.

16:36.620 --> 16:41.220
I won't kill you, but I will 
have you judged under the law.

16:41.220 --> 16:43.550
Tsk. Damn that mermaid.

16:43.550 --> 16:46.730
I'll have to punish her good later.

16:46.730 --> 16:49.190
Get him, boys!

17:04.330 --> 17:05.580
Damn it!

17:23.770 --> 17:27.140
You ruffians had the nerve 
to use an innocent mermaid.

17:27.140 --> 17:29.080
I will put an end to your story—

17:29.080 --> 17:30.020
Move.

17:40.630 --> 17:42.970
I can fight with you.

17:51.620 --> 17:54.140
H-Hang on! You've got it all wrong!

17:54.140 --> 17:56.590
That mermaid had us under her control!

17:59.690 --> 18:01.880
Where is the mermaid's friend?

18:09.780 --> 18:12.820
That's... probably Shike's friend, right?

18:14.260 --> 18:16.630
They packed her up like cargo.

18:29.610 --> 18:31.540
Emergency.

18:37.400 --> 18:40.570
You're the mermaid called Misaki, right?

18:40.570 --> 18:41.390
Yeah.

18:41.850 --> 18:44.440
Oh, we can change our fins into feet.

18:44.440 --> 18:46.430
We can't use our powers 
when we do, though.

18:47.290 --> 18:48.330
Perv.

18:48.330 --> 18:49.800
I wasn't looking, okay?!

18:49.800 --> 18:51.070
Report.

18:51.070 --> 18:53.440
Wait! What are you gonna 
report, and to who?!

18:56.290 --> 18:59.950
Misaki! I was so worried!

19:00.600 --> 19:05.350
There, there. You think I'd 
kick the bucket that easily?

19:06.020 --> 19:09.710
Man, you guys saved my skin! 
I really appreciate it!

19:09.710 --> 19:10.960
You're taking this lightly.

19:13.160 --> 19:16.500
Thank you so much for saving Misaki.

19:16.500 --> 19:18.830
We owe you our lives.

19:19.180 --> 19:21.720
I'm really grateful, too.

19:23.510 --> 19:27.180
Hey, let me sing a special song 
for you to show my gratitude!

19:27.500 --> 19:28.450
A song?!

19:28.830 --> 19:30.190
Don't worry.

19:30.190 --> 19:32.630
It won't put you to sleep.

19:32.630 --> 19:36.230
It's called "Thank You for Saving Us."

19:36.230 --> 19:38.060
Not the most creative title...

19:43.990 --> 19:49.830


19:49.830 --> 19:56.210


19:56.210 --> 20:02.650


20:02.650 --> 20:08.330


20:09.220 --> 20:14.980


20:14.980 --> 20:21.110


20:21.570 --> 20:27.370


20:27.710 --> 20:33.590


20:30.520 --> 20:31.630
I won't lose.

20:34.250 --> 20:40.500


20:37.940 --> 20:40.090
Whoo! Not bad!

20:40.090 --> 20:43.350
Goodness, what is even going on?

20:40.500 --> 20:46.220


20:43.350 --> 20:45.870
Yeah, baby! It's getting good now!

20:46.740 --> 20:53.080


20:52.800 --> 20:54.460
Wow...

20:53.080 --> 20:59.870


21:04.290 --> 21:05.250
Well, see ya.

21:05.780 --> 21:07.930
Thank you so much for your help.

21:08.340 --> 21:10.710
Don't get caught by any 
more bad people, okay?

21:15.290 --> 21:17.810
You were without sin, 
and I tried to kill you.

21:19.910 --> 21:20.930
I'm sorry.

21:27.860 --> 21:29.400
G-Goodbye!

21:30.970 --> 21:33.520
Bye! Hope to see you again!

21:42.460 --> 21:43.500
Dislike.

21:43.940 --> 21:44.400
Eh?

21:45.470 --> 21:47.220
First... apology.

21:47.220 --> 21:48.490
Huh? What are you—

22:03.920 --> 22:06.090
Damn it, what the hell was—

22:13.180 --> 22:15.810
Uh, wait. What did you guys just do?

22:16.270 --> 22:21.310
What?!
